[statement]
A blank line ends a record only once it has a name. The fields of a part
without `P:` carry into the record after it: here `after` provides `bad`
and depends on `dep`, so a request for `bad` installs `after`.

[repository verbatim]
C:Q1AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA=
V:1.0-r0
p:bad=1
D:dep

C:Q1BBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBB=
P:after
V:2.0-r0

C:Q1DDDDDDDDDDDDDDDDDDDDDDDDDDD=
P:dep
V:1.0-r0

[request]
bad

[answer apk-tools 3.0.9-r0]
install dep 1.0-r0
install after 2.0-r0
